{
  "slug": "mock-cable-beanie",
  "title": "Mock cable beanie",
  "subtitle": "A cabled-looking beanie with no cable needle required.",
  "excerpt": "A bottom-up beanie in aran yarn using a mock cable stitch pattern that produces the look of a 4-stitch cable without a cable needle. A 4-round repeat over 4-stitch panels gives strong vertical cables. Fits adult heads 54 to 61 cm.",
